* ============================================================
* TESTBENCH — 4th-Order Continuous-Time Low Pass Filter
* ============================================================

* ============================================================
* GLOBAL PARAMETERS
* ============================================================
.TEMP 27
.PARAM vddnom   = 3.3
.PARAM vref_val = 1.65

* ============================================================
* SUPPLY SOURCES
* ============================================================
* Main supply — 3.3 V
VDD  vdda 0 DC vddnom
* Analog ground — 0 V
VSS  vssa 0 DC 0
* Reference voltage — virtual mid-rail (1.65 V)
* Required to bias the non-inverting inputs of the op-amps
VREF vref 0 DC vref_val

* ============================================================
* CONTROL SIGNALS (Power-Down)
* ============================================================
* PD  = 0 — active-low shutdown; 0 keeps the amplifier ON
V_pd  pd  0 DC 0
* XPD = 3.3 V — active-high enable; VDD keeps the amplifier ON
V_xpd xpd 0 DC vddnom

* ============================================================
* INPUT STIMULUS
* ============================================================
* Sine wave centred on Vref (1.65 V)
* Offset = 1.65 V, Amplitude = 0.5 V, Frequency = 100 kHz
* Uncomment for transient simulation:
*Vin V_in 0 SIN(vref_val 0.5 100k)
* AC small-signal source for Bode plot:
Vin V_in 0 DC 1.65 AC 1

* ============================================================
* FILTER INSTANTIATION
* ============================================================
* Pin order: V_in V_out vdda vssa vref pd xpd
Xdut V_in V_out vdda vssa vref pd xpd FILTER

* ============================================================
* OUTPUT LOAD
* ============================================================
Cload V_out 0 1p

* ============================================================
* INCLUDE FILES
* ============================================================
* Load models in dependency order
.INCLUDE subcircuit_files/PRIMITIVE.sub
.INCLUDE subcircuit_files/OPAMP1.sub
.INCLUDE subcircuit_files/FILTER.sub
* Process corner models
.INCLUDE process_models/typical.process

* ============================================================
* ANALYSES
* ============================================================
* Transient — 
* Uncomment to enable:
*.TRAN 0.1u 200u

* AC (Bode plot) — 
.AC DEC 20 1k 10Meg

* ============================================================
* AUTOMATIC MEASUREMENTS
* ============================================================
* 1. Gain at 20 kHz  — magnitude of V_out
.MEAS AC Gain_20k     FIND vm(V_out) AT=20k
* 2. Gain at 100 kHz
.MEAS AC Gain_100k    FIND vm(V_out) AT=100k
* 3. Cut-off frequency — 
.MEAS AC Freq_Cutoff  WHEN vm(V_out)=0.426

.END
